# Ordered XNU patches for iOS 16.7.16 on the OnePlus 6.
#
# The 184 sweet-* patches come from the community iOS-on-Snapdragon port
# (repos/ios-enchilada-fork).  They are written against xnu-8796.141.3 and
# applied here as one block: measured 182/184 on a clean tree.  The two that
# failed there (0031 and 0041) fail only because they touch bsd/sweet_hfs
# before it exists, so this series lists them after 0026-stage-hfs.sh.  A
# series entry ending in .sh is executed from the XNU root by scripts/unixnu
# patches.py instead of being applied as a diff: the three community stagers
# fetch libpthread, BearSSL and HFS at their pinned commits.
#
# The official profiles/arch/arm64 series is deliberately NOT used: those
# 56 patches are written against xnu-10063 and only 44 apply here, while
# layering both series rejects 151 of the community patches because they
# are two implementations of the same layer.

